---
layout: base.njk
title: "AeroClub | Recruitment"
---
<style>

        .btn-join { background: var(--accent-cyan); color: #fff; padding: 12px 28px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; transition: background 0.2s; }
        .btn-join:hover { background: #0284C7; }

        /* ==========================================
           PAGE CONTENT (HOME PAGE)
        ========================================== */
        .hero {
            height: calc(100vh - 80px);
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            overflow: hidden;
            background-color: var(--bg-deep);
        }
        
        /* The Engineering Grid Overlay */
        .hero::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background-image: 
                linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 40px 40px;
            background-position: center center;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        /* Radial vignette to fade the grid smoothly into the dark */
        .hero::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at center right, transparent 0%, var(--bg-deep) 80%);
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .hero-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 3;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .hero-text h1 { font-size: 72px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.05; margin-bottom: 24px; max-width: 850px; letter-spacing: -2px; color: var(--text-light); }
        .hero-text p { font-size: 16px; color: var(--accent-cyan); max-width: 600px; margin-bottom: 40px; font-family: var(--font-data); letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; }

        /* ==========================================
           GLOBAL FOOTER
        ========================================== */
        footer { background: var(--bg-deep); border-top: 1px solid var(--border-dark); margin-top: auto; }
        .map-container { width: 100%; height: 350px; background: #111; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-dark); }
        .map-container iframe { width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0; filter: invert(90%) hue-rotate(180deg) contrast(1.1); }
        
        .footer-content { padding: 80px 0 40px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-dark); margin-bottom: 24px; }
        .footer-brand .logo { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 16px; display: block; }
        .footer-brand .logo span { color: var(--accent-cyan); }
        .footer-brand p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 24px; max-width: 300px; }
        .contact-info li { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        
        .footer-links h4 { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: var(--text-light); text-transform: uppercase; }
        .footer-links ul li { margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .footer-links ul a { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 14px; transition: color 0.2s; }
        .footer-links ul a:hover { color: var(--accent-cyan); }

        .footer-bottom { padding-bottom: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 14px; }
        
        /* ==========================================
           HOMEPAGE SPECIFIC SECTIONS
        ========================================== */
        .stats-bar { background: var(--bg-panel-dark); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-dark); padding: 40px 0; }
        .stats-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); text-align: center; gap: 24px; }
        .stat-value { font-size: 48px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent-cyan); margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1; }
        .stat-label { font-family: var(--font-data); font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; }
        
        .home-section { padding: 80px 0; }
        
        .mission-split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: center; }
        .mission-text h2 { font-size: 40px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 24px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
        .mission-text h2 span { color: var(--accent-cyan); }
        .mission-text p { font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 32px; }
        
        /* Clean, high-contrast button (No neon blue outline) */
        .btn-outline { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 28px; border: 1px solid var(--border-dark); background: var(--bg-deep); color: var(--text-light); border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; transition: all 0.2s ease; }
        .btn-outline:hover { background: var(--text-light); color: var(--bg-deep); border-color: var(--text-light); }
        
        .mission-typo { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
        .mission-typo h3 { font-size: 72px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 0.9; color: transparent; -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.15); text-transform: uppercase; transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.1, 0.25, 1); cursor: default; }
        .mission-typo h3.active { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); -webkit-text-stroke: 0; }
        .mission-typo h3:hover { color: var(--accent-cyan); -webkit-text-stroke: 0; transform: translateX(12px); }
        
        /* Fleet Carousel */
        .fleet-carousel { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; background: var(--bg-panel-dark); border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border-dark); overflow: hidden; }
        .fleet-slide { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 40px; padding: 60px 80px; width: 100%; }
        .fleet-info { flex: 1; z-index: 2; }
        .fleet-info h3 { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-light); } /* Explicitly white title */
        .fleet-info p { font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 32px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .fleet-image { flex: 1; display: flex; justify-content: center; }
        .fleet-image img { max-width: 100%; max-height: 300px; object-fit: contain; filter: drop-shadow(0 20px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5)); }
        
        .carousel-btn { position: absolute; background: rgba(11, 17, 33, 0.5); border: 1px solid var(--border-dark); color: var(--text-light); width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 18px; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s; z-index: 10; }
        .carousel-btn:hover { background: var(--bg-deep); border-color: var(--text-light); }
        .carousel-prev { left: 16px; }
        .carousel-next { right: 16px; }
        
        .news-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: 40px; }
        .news-header h2 { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; }
        .news-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
        
        /* Clean Dual-Color News Cards (No float/glow) */
        .news-card { background: var(--bg-deep); border: 1px solid var(--border-dark); display: flex; flex-direction: column; transition: border-color 0.2s; overflow: hidden; }
        .news-card:hover { border-color: var(--text-light); } /* Sharp, architectural border contrast */
        .news-img { height: 200px; overflow: hidden; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-dark); }
        .news-img img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; filter: grayscale(40%); transition: filter 0.3s; }
        .news-card:hover .news-img img { filter: grayscale(0%); }
        .news-content { padding: 32px; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
        .news-meta { font-family: var(--font-data); font-size: 12px; color: var(--accent-cyan); margin-bottom: 12px; display: block; letter-spacing: 1px; }
        .news-card h4 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--text-light); }
        .news-card p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 24px; flex: 1; }
        .learn-more { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-light); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
        .learn-more::after { content: '→'; transition: transform 0.2s; }
        .news-card:hover .learn-more::after { transform: translateX(6px); }

        /* Strategic Partners Grid */
        .partners-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: 40px; }
        .partners-header h2 { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; }
        .partners-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
        
        /* Vertical, solid cards with pure white logos */
        .partner-logo { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; padding: 40px; height: 220px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--bg-panel-dark); border: 1px solid var(--border-dark); transition: border-color 0.2s ease; }
        .partner-logo img { max-width: 85%; max-height: 90px; object-fit: contain; filter: brightness(0) invert(1); /* Forces any logo to be pure, opaque white */ transition: transform 0.2s ease; }
        .partner-logo:hover { border-color: var(--text-light); }
        .partner-logo:hover img { transform: scale(1.05); }
        
        .marquee-wrapper { overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; padding: 60px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-dark); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-dark); background: var(--bg-panel-dark); }
        .marquee-content { display: inline-flex; gap: 80px; align-items: center; animation: marquee 20s linear infinite; opacity: 0.5; }
        .marquee-content span { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; }
        @keyframes marquee { 0% { transform: translateX(0); } 100% { transform: translateX(-50%); } }
        
        .launch-cta { text-align: center; padding: 100px 0; }
        .launch-cta h2 { font-size: 48px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 24px; }
        .launch-cta p { font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 40px; }
</style>

<main id="join-page">
        
        <!-- Standardized Page Header -->
        <section style="padding: 80px 0 40px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-dark);">
            <div class="container">
                <h4 style="font-family: var(--font-data); color: #10B981; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                    <span style="width: 8px; height: 8px; background: #10B981; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; box-shadow: 0 0 12px #10B981;"></span>
                    STATUS: ACTIVE RECRUITMENT
                </h4>
                <h2 style="font-size: 48px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-light); letter-spacing: -1px;">Spring 2027 Induction</h2>
                <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 700px;">We are currently evaluating candidates for the core engineering, telemetry, and payload integration divisions.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Recruitment Pipeline Dashboard -->
        <section style="padding: 80px 0 140px;">
            <div class="container" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 60px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0;">
                
                <!-- PHASE 1: APPLICATIONS (Currently Active Example) -->
                <div style="background: var(--bg-panel-dark); border: 1px solid var(--accent-cyan); border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-cyan); padding: 40px; border-radius: 4px;">
                    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px;">
                        <div>
                            <h4 style="font-family: var(--font-data); color: var(--accent-cyan); font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 8px; letter-spacing: 1px;">PHASE 01 // OPEN</h4>
                            <h3 style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-light);">Initial Applications</h3>
                        </div>
                        <span style="background: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.1); color: var(--accent-cyan); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: var(--font-data); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;">DEADLINE: FEB 15</span>
                    </div>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 32px;">Please complete the technical background form. Ensure you are logged in using your official institutional email address. This form acts as your primary dossier for the induction process.</p>
                    <a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-join" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; border: none; padding: 14px 32px;">
                        Submit Application Form ↗
                    </a>
                </div>

                <!-- PHASE 2: TESTING (Pending Example) -->
                <div style="background: var(--bg-deep); border: 1px solid var(--border-dark); padding: 40px; border-radius: 4px;">
                    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px;">
                        <div>
                            <h4 style="font-family: var(--font-data); color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 8px; letter-spacing: 1px;">PHASE 02 // PENDING</h4>
                            <h3 style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-light);">Aptitude & Technical Testing</h3>
                        </div>
                        <span style="border: 1px solid var(--border-dark); color: var(--text-muted); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: var(--font-data); font-size: 12px;">DATE: FEB 20</span>
                    </div>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 24px;">A comprehensive examination evaluating physics, logical reasoning, and domain-specific knowledge (Aerodynamics/Electronics/Coding). Syllabus details and venue will be published here 48 hours prior.</p>
                    <div style="background: #111; padding: 16px; border: 1px dashed var(--border-dark); color: var(--text-muted); font-family: var(--font-data); font-size: 13px;">
                        > Awaiting Phase 01 completion to generate manifest.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- PHASE 3: INTERVIEWS (Pending Example) -->
                <div style="background: var(--bg-deep); border: 1px solid var(--border-dark); padding: 40px; border-radius: 4px;">
                    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px;">
                        <div>
                            <h4 style="font-family: var(--font-data); color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 8px; letter-spacing: 1px;">PHASE 03 // PENDING</h4>
                            <h3 style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-light);">Technical Interviews</h3>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 24px;">Candidates who clear the technical barrier will be called for a panel interview with division leads. Shortlisted names and interview time-slots will be embedded below.</p>
                    <div style="background: #111; padding: 16px; border: 1px dashed var(--border-dark); color: var(--text-muted); font-family: var(--font-data); font-size: 13px;">
                        > Awaiting Phase 02 completion.
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
